  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: Unlike the <b>Rigidbody</b> component used for 3D objects, the <b>Rigidbody 2D</b> component is optimized for 2D physics. This component enables your objects to obey the laws of physics, such as gravity and force, within a 2D space.
